# IndexNow (Bing/Yandex instant crawl notification).
# 1. Generate a stable UUID and set it as INDEXNOW_KEY.
# 2. Put the same UUID inside a static file at apps/web/public/{UUID}.txt
#    so verification at https://foxing.app/{UUID}.txt returns the key.
# When unset, notifyIndexNow() is a no-op.
INDEXNOW_KEY=
